   "id": 493912,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Use the roster method or set builder notation to represent the collection of all musical instruments.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The roster method lists the elements of the set. Set builder notation uses a letter to represent a sample member of the set, a vertical bar, and then a description of a sample member. In this case, because it is not practical to list all musical instruments, it is much easier to use set builder notation.</p>\n<span data-math=\"I = \\left\\{ {i|i\\,\\,{\\rm{is\\ a\\ musical\\ instrument}}} \\right\\}\"></span>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"I = \\{i|i{\\text{ }}{\\text{is a musical instrument}}\\}\">I = \\{i|i{\\text{ }}{\\text{is a musical instrument}}\\}</span>"
    }
